# Branching

Workflow: GitHub Flow.

## Branches

- Branch from `main` as `{{config.git.branchPrefix}}<short-name>`.
- `main` stays deployable. Ship by merging the pull request.

## Pull requests

- Open a pull request for every change.
- Cap the diff at {{config.git.maxPrLines}} lines, excluding lockfiles.
- At least one human review before merge.

## Commits

Use Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, `chore:`.
